// One motive at the fitted weight, with the label count in the score.
// No pair returns nothing. Zero is not a hit count.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE labrank ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG labrank rank

IMPULSE labrank 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "labrank" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
